{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-CN","id":"ep-10","no":"EP.10","tag":"第10话 · 正午演出作战","title":"正午演出作战","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-10:1","s":"n","t":"摩卡的地下厨房墙上贴起一张大纸，顶部歪歪扭扭写着：正午演出作战。","bg":"siksangNight","bgm":"siksangEnter","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:2","s":"yeon","t":"好，开会。目标是把太阳推到正午。","x":"excited","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"excited"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-10:3","s":"moka","t":"听一句童话就制定作战的猪，我第一次见。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:4","s":"yeon","t":"那童话可是你提的。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:5","s":"neo","t":"准备三样就好。高舞台，一起唱的人，还有发出第一声的勇气。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-10:6","s":"yeon","t":"舞台就选岛上最高的，黑羽落下的那座。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:7","s":"moka","t":"日晷舞台。以前每到正午就演出，现在是乌鸦窝。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:8","s":"yeon","t":"人我来召集，宣传我有自信。","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-10:9","s":"moka","t":"禁歌的岛上，你怎么宣传歌唱演出。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:10","s":"yeon","t":"不写歌唱就行。正午免费烤串，这样大家都来。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:11","s":"moka","t":"那些串谁烤。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:12","s":"yeon","t":"岛上最会烤串的水獭，是谁来着。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-10:13","s":"neo","t":"声音会变火的猪，居然要去宣传。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:14","s":"yeon","t":"那个我会控制，大概。","x":"shy"},{"id":"ep-10:15","s":"moka","t":"那么最后，谁发第一声。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:16","s":"n","t":"Yeoni和Yeongnyangi同时看向摩卡。摩卡拿着汤勺往后退。"},{"id":"ep-10:17","s":"moka","t":"看我干吗。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:18","s":"yeon","t":"岛上节奏最好的水獭，是谁来着。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:19","s":"moka","t":"都说是食谱了！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:20","s":"neo","t":"正午时念食谱，念到远方也听得见。","x":"soft","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 neo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:21","s":"moka","t":"……猫，你原来也会开玩笑。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-10:22","s":"neo","t":"不是玩笑。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:23","s":"n","t":"Yeoni走向灰色市场。想召集人，得先见到人。","bg":"siksang2","tone":"desat","bgm":"memWater","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksang2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:24","s":"n","t":"市场依旧安静，巷口却传来小小的声音。笃，笃笃。是筷子敲木箱。","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"think"}},{"id":"ep-10:25","s":"yeon","t":"有声音？还有没被盖印的人？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:26","s":"n","t":"一个约十岁的男孩坐在箱前，手背干净，没有印。他看见Yeoni，把筷子藏到背后。","r":null},{"id":"ep-10:27","s":"yeon","t":"别藏。我不是巡查队，如你所见，是猪。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-10:28","s":"n","t":"孩子看了Yeoni许久，噗地笑了，再敲起箱子。笃，笃笃，笃。"},{"id":"ep-10:29","s":"yeon","t":"节奏不错，你打过鼓吧？","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-10:30","s":"n","t":"孩子点头，却突然歪头。表情像想不起是什么时候打过。"},{"id":"ep-10:31","s":"yeon","t":"叫什么名字？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:32","s":"n","t":"孩子的嘴张开又闭上，再张开，没有任何名字出来。"},{"id":"ep-10:33","s":"yeon","t":"没事。想不起来，以后再说也行。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:34","s":"neo","t":"孩子，你妈妈或朋友怎么叫你？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:35","s":"n","t":"孩子耸肩，像不懂这么简单的问题，自己为什么没答案。"},{"id":"ep-10:36","s":"n","t":"孩子想用手指在箱上写什么，划出第一笔后停住，不知道第二笔该往哪走。","sfx":"heartbeat","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang2","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:37","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni，看孩子的手腕。","x":"serious","c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-10:38","s":"n","t":"孩子腕上有金线痕迹，像曾绑上线又剪断，留下细伤疤，还残留一点金色。"},{"id":"ep-10:39","s":"neo","t":"这是债线被切断的痕迹，可名字也一起断掉了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-10:40","s":"yeon","t":"我好像知道是谁干的。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-10:41","s":"n","t":"Yeoni想起地下舞台地上的那缕金线，同样的颜色。"},{"id":"ep-10:42","s":"yeon","t":"那我先给你个称呼。鼓队长，怎么样？","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-10:43","s":"n","t":"孩子瞪圆眼，随后用最大的声响敲箱。笃，笃，咚。"},{"id":"ep-10:44","s":"yeon","t":"是喜欢的意思吧？鼓队长，正午和我们一起演出吧。","x":"laugh","fx":"heart","sfx":"drum","scene":{"background":"siksang2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang2","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"heart","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang2 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-10:45","s":"n","t":"海边山丘。Yeongnyangi坐在岩石上开始授课，学生是一头猪、一只水獭、一个鼓队长。","bg":"siksang3","bgm":"innerFlame","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:46","s":"neo","t":"用火有两种方式，一是食神，一是伤官。","x":"lecture","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"base"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"lecture"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-10:47","s":"yeon","t":"哦，终于开技能树了？","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-10:48","s":"neo","t":"没有树，只有串。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:49","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi示意摩卡。摩卡把六串放上烤网。"},{"id":"ep-10:50","s":"neo","t":"先食神。把火送向串，不要生气，只想着变好吃。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-10:51","s":"yeon","t":"变好吃吧。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:52","s":"n","t":"Yeoni朝烤网伸出前蹄，什么也没发生。再伸，一串稍微热了。"},{"id":"ep-10:53","s":"moka","t":"温吞吞。端给客人，会得一星。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:54","s":"yeon","t":"你知道你现在在我心里点火吗？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:55","s":"n","t":"刹那间，六串一起卷入火焰，转眼成了炭。","fx":"fire","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"fire","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:56","s":"moka","t":"我的串！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:57","s":"neo","t":"那就是伤官。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:58","s":"yeon","t":"呃，抱歉。一生气，就全冲出去了。","x":"shy"},{"id":"ep-10:59","s":"neo","t":"是同样的火，只是心看的方向不同。再来。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-10:60","s":"n","t":"又六串摆上去。Yeoni闭眼，想起奶奶的小吃摊，给唱不好的客人两串的奶奶。"},{"id":"ep-10:61","s":"n","t":"烤网上响起酱油收汁声，串均匀地变得金黄。摩卡拿一串尝了尝。","sfx":"sparkle"},{"id":"ep-10:62","s":"moka","t":"……四星。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-10:63","s":"yeon","t":"四星？为什么不能五星？","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-10:64","s":"moka","t":"五星是我奶奶的，别觊觎。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:65","s":"neo","t":"接着伤官。伤官是刃，刃须用得精准而集中。只切断那根绳。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-10:66","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi指向岩石边悬着的绳，绳尾挂着空锅。"},{"id":"ep-10:67","s":"yeon","t":"用话切断对吧，一句话？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:68","s":"neo","t":"用最短、最准的话。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-10:69","s":"yeon","t":"断开！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:70","s":"n","t":"两个火字飞出，削掉绳旁的岩石，把锅打飞，落入海里。绳完好无损。","fx":"claw","scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:71","s":"moka","t":"那锅是奶奶的！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:72","s":"yeon","t":"今天奶奶的遗物牺牲太多了。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-10:73","s":"n","t":"Yeoni又喊十次，第九次终于割断绳。鼓队长敲箱，咚，咚。"},{"id":"ep-10:74","s":"neo","t":"行了，记住刚才的感觉。","x":"soft","sfx":"drum"},{"id":"ep-10:75","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi起身时踉跄了一下，正是右前爪落地时。它若无其事地又坐下。","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:76","s":"yeon","t":"Yeongnyangi，腿麻了？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:77","s":"neo","t":"猫坐久了也会麻。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:78","s":"moka","t":"猫几岁了？","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:79","s":"neo","t":"别问。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:80","s":"yeon","t":"原来是老爷爷猫。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:81","s":"neo","t":"说了别问。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:82","s":"moka","t":"现在轮到我了吧，练习。","x":"base","bgm":"daily","scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-10:83","s":"yeon","t":"哦哦，食谱朗读彩排！","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-10:84","s":"n","t":"摩卡爬上岩石。猪、猫、孩子抬头望着，它张开嘴。"},{"id":"ep-10:85","s":"n","t":"没有声音出来。不是因为印，摩卡手上没有印。"},{"id":"ep-10:86","s":"moka","t":"……闭眼，大家。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:87","s":"yeon","t":"就我们三个看也不行？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:88","s":"moka","t":"三个最可怕，锅不会盯着我。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:89","s":"n","t":"鼓队长从包里拿锅盖挡住脸，Yeoni也照做，Yeongnyangi用前爪遮眼。"},{"id":"ep-10:90","s":"moka","t":"酱油两勺，糖一勺。火要猛，心要柔。","x":"base","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:91","s":"n","t":"声音很小，却有节拍。鼓队长在盖后拍膝，Yeoni的尾巴随着节奏摇。"},{"id":"ep-10:92","s":"yeon","t":"看吧，隔一只锅盖就行了。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:93","s":"moka","t":"正午要叫全岛人都拿锅盖挡脸？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:94","s":"yeon","t":"也不错啊，锅盖庆典。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-10:95","s":"n","t":"黄昏丝毫不动的傍晚，Yeoni抱着传单走巷子。传单只画图：太阳、烤串、笑脸。","bg":"siksangNight","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:96","s":"n","t":"巷口一盏灯灭了。Yeoni停步，现在知道这个顺序了。","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-10:97","s":"tiger","t":"传单挺可爱，画技两星。","x":"talk","r":{"who":"tiger","x":"base"},"fx":"veil","scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"veil","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 tiger의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-10:98","s":"yeon","t":"别给别人宣传物评分。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:99","s":"tiger","t":"正午演出，传遍了，乌鸦也知道。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:100","s":"yeon","t":"……这么快？","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-10:101","s":"tiger","t":"这岛上，传闻比歌快。歌被禁，传闻没禁。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-10:102","s":"n","t":"黑虎打开账本，里面一行空白，最上方写着Yeoni的名字。"},{"id":"ep-10:103","s":"tiger","t":"所以提个建议，借你掌声。正午会有一千人在台下为你鼓掌。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:104","s":"yeon","t":"一千人？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:105","s":"tiger","t":"掌声够大，太阳也会升。唱得生疏些也无妨，保证。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-10:106","s":"n","t":"Yeoni望着账本，空白那行闪光。看起来容易，容易得过分。"},{"id":"ep-10:107","s":"yeon","t":"利息呢？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:108","s":"tiger","t":"现在也会问这种事了。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:109","s":"yeon","t":"在地下舞台学的，学费是Yeoul姐的声音。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:110","s":"tiger","t":"以后再定，对你便宜点。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:111","s":"yeon","t":"不要。","x":"angry","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:112","s":"n","t":"黑虎的尾巴停了。"},{"id":"ep-10:113","s":"yeon","t":"靠借来的掌声升起的太阳，还债时又会落下吧。那这座岛就得一辈子给你付利息。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:114","s":"yeon","t":"再生疏，也要用真正的掌声托起它。不升，明天再唱。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:115","s":"tiger","t":"……也许不会有明天呢？","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-10:116","s":"yeon","t":"你在担心我？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:117","s":"tiger","t":"谈生意而已。客人消失，账本就空了。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:118","s":"yeon","t":"那今天唱好不就行了。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:119","s":"n","t":"黑虎合上账本，声音比平常稍响。","sfx":"thud","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:120","s":"tiger","t":"债欠着就会长，没欠下的也一样。拒绝的代价，我另收。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:121","s":"tiger","t":"还有，Yeoni。今晚别上屋顶。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-10:122","s":"yeon","t":"什么意思，警告还是威胁？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:123","s":"n","t":"没有回答。灯再次亮起时，巷里已空无一人。"},{"id":"ep-10:124","s":"n","t":"那夜Yeoni睡不着，轻轻推开地下厨房的盖子，爬上屋顶。越不让做的事，越好奇。","bg":"siksangNight","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis","shot":"quiet","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:125","s":"yeon","t":"只练一次，很小声。","x":"calm","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"calm"}},{"id":"ep-10:126","s":"n","t":"Yeoni望向日晷舞台，哼起歌。sol到mi，正是被网吊在法庭时遭嘲笑的音高。莫名心情很好。"},{"id":"ep-10:127","s":"n","t":"哼歌将结束时，无月的天又黑了一块。是翅膀。","sfx":"heartbeat"},{"id":"ep-10:128","s":"crow","t":"让正午舞台响起的声音。","x":"base","r":{"who":"crow","x":"base"},"im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 crow의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:129","s":"crow","t":"没收。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-10:130","s":"yeon","t":"等等，判决只能在法庭，不对，原来没这种法律。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-10:131","s":"n","t":"乌鸦张嘴，一根光线从Yeoni喉中抽出，以sol和mi的形状颤动，被吸入面具里。","fx":"suck","sfx":"whoosh","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"suck","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:132","s":"n","t":"Yeoni想喊，气息经过喉咙，却什么也没出来。"},{"id":"ep-10:133","s":"n","t":"乌鸦飞走。屋顶上只剩一头猪和一根黑羽。","bgm":"none","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:134","s":"n","t":"下面响起开盖声，Yeongnyangi正爬上来。Yeoni喊它。"},{"id":"ep-10:135","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi。嘴形分明这样动了，却没有一点声音。","im":true,"shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
